<p> Full listing of the content of the magnitudes table and description of the
columns. These properties are contained in tables denoted
[modelname]_Magnitudes. This table contains absolute rest-frame magnitudes
without dust attenuation for all galaxies with M<sub>*</sub>>10<sup>8.5</sup>
Msol contained in the   SubHalo table. This table can be joined to the SubHalo
table using the GalaxyID field. The magnitudes in the different SDSS and UKIRT
filters have been computed in 30 pkpc spherical apertures following the
procedure described by Trayford et al. 2015. </p>

