<tr><td><p>SnapNum</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Snapshot at which this galaxy exists.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p>u_nodust</p></td><td><p>mag</p></td><td><p>Rest-frame absolute magnitude (AB) in the u band without dust attenuation.</p></td></tr>
